  <p>Use these calculators to support your TDEE-based plan:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/tdee-calculator/">TDEE calculator</a> — find your maintenance calories instantly</li>
    <li><a href="/bmr-calculator/">BMR calculator</a> — your resting metabolic baseline</li>
