    <li><a href="/weight-gain-calculator/">Weight gain calculator</a> — plan a lean bulk</li>
    <li><a href="/calories-burned-calculator/">Calories burned calculator</a> — see how exercise changes your daily total</li>
  </ul>
</ContentLayout>
